:db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-129149" :question/id #uuid "57f0244e-104a-5517-a9c5-a53620a2a15d" :question/math-academy-id "q-129149" :question/problem "Calculate ${\\int }_{0}^{3}[2f(t)+4g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t$ given that ${\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-3,\\,\\sqrt{2},\\,2⟩$ and ${\\int }_{0}^{3}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-\\frac{3}{2},\\,-\\frac{1}{4},\\,1⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "From the vector addition and scalar multiplication rules, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{3}[2f(t)+4g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t=2{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+4{\\int }_{0}^{3}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{3}[2f(t)+4g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t & =2{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+4{\\int }_{0}^{3}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =2⟨-3,\\,\\sqrt{2},\\,2⟩+4⟨-\\frac{3}{2},\\,-\\frac{1}{4},\\,1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-6,\\,2\\sqrt{2},\\,4⟩+⟨-6,\\,-1,\\,4⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-12,\\,2\\sqrt{2}-1,\\,8⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-129149/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0333b70a-2ede-5c8d-b298-4d25ae4d4667"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-129149"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-98156/selection/bf822fe9adf1ddaf18dbaa790b1f77177f13a0026cac5c2752745c0ec077fef3" :answer/id #uuid "556038da-4620-5bcf-939c-6ac78f2f1779" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-1,\\,-10,\\,4⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98156/selection/f75f593951a6f3f74d9972fb24d9523a6cc441f76e5f9a881e5b8fb5c8853ba1" :answer/id #uuid "0426f8d6-2057-56c3-af58-f7b992a2ae12" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨4,\\,-1,\\,-10⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98156/selection/e82a2c961d877f89a46062f9596c12b5a47ca5ed652fc42efda225894dcbac0b" :answer/id #uuid "00230a87-924d-5c48-bab7-e56577d4377d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨3,\\,6,\\,-6⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98156/selection/238f4422e2d7724de96df3dda61d750b4fbe3e3b0325500b6d125e7ade64a920" :answer/id #uuid "deb49c2a-bc4b-5c0c-b664-42d7caa17277" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-1,\\,2,\\,4⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98156/selection/4946ba7db57726a7fde7fa14b8e20d86a71140af8eec0576aea434f6b2728e49" :answer/id #uuid "64269ad0-69a9-5342-a4c6-dbdb41465652" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨5,\\,-10,\\,4⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98156/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "5c61daf6-a536-595f-8f34-877d9e09e1a6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-98156/selection/bf822fe9adf1ddaf18dbaa790b1f77177f13a0026cac5c2752745c0ec077fef3" :answer-field/choices ["q-98156/selection/bf822fe9adf1ddaf18dbaa790b1f77177f13a0026cac5c2752745c0ec077fef3" "q-98156/selection/f75f593951a6f3f74d9972fb24d9523a6cc441f76e5f9a881e5b8fb5c8853ba1" "q-98156/selection/e82a2c961d877f89a46062f9596c12b5a47ca5ed652fc42efda225894dcbac0b" "q-98156/selection/238f4422e2d7724de96df3dda61d750b4fbe3e3b0325500b6d125e7ade64a920" "q-98156/selection/4946ba7db57726a7fde7fa14b8e20d86a71140af8eec0576aea434f6b2728e49"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-98156" :question/id #uuid "1935c2be-c32a-56ae-84f1-4cccd8b2f790" :question/math-academy-id "q-98156" :question/problem "Calculate \n${\\int }_{2}^{3}[f(t)-3g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t$ \ngiven that \n${\\int }_{2}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨2,\\,-4,\\,-2⟩$\nand \n${\\int }_{2}^{3}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨1,\\,2,\\,-2⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "From the vector addition and scalar multiplication rules, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{2}^{3}[f(t)-3g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{2}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-3{\\int }_{2}^{3}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{2}^{3}[f(t)-3g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{2}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-3{\\int }_{2}^{3}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨2,\\,-4,\\,-2⟩-3⟨1,\\,2,\\,-2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2,\\,-4,\\,-2⟩-⟨3,\\,6,\\,-6⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-1,\\,-10,\\,4⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-98156/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0333b70a-2ede-5c8d-b298-4d25ae4d4667"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-98156"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-98172/selection/d4424dee5882fe24ce33b6d745870c317cae906b0ddc48d0f59086680be71877" :answer/id #uuid "16be50ba-7958-50d0-8f9f-5f2850c69b58" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨2,\\,-5,\\,-7⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98172/selection/83b77631d3c09c4fa65d5479e3bc4e111b6c74038becc428a014e32539abe18d" :answer/id #uuid "eb7fa201-46fa-53ae-83c5-db2bc43835d6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-8,\\,15,\\,-7⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98172/selection/7f9505671c58abccf439575598eeec0084788c95c03b11d193fb19cc1cc9fc36" :answer/id #uuid "55c9bf69-f576-583e-b50a-10069a2e43d8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-4,\\,10,\\,14⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98172/selection/318eee683aae2a46f205bfe4f4689edbc0a16aa3ff94d37e2f6277a0545ad782" :answer/id #uuid "31f764fa-9cd5-5a89-9c77-8ce207c89f27" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-2,\\,5,\\,7⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98172/selection/03780b0af37883af25ced9c3bd0efb33896f2e93d42008232a40bdc73b0952ec" :answer/id #uuid "40360cac-40a6-55d9-822d-515297c5b7f3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨4,\\,10,\\,14⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98172/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "e0cec9df-1445-5cac-b424-6a3a929f2351" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-98172/selection/318eee683aae2a46f205bfe4f4689edbc0a16aa3ff94d37e2f6277a0545ad782" :answer-field/choices ["q-98172/selection/d4424dee5882fe24ce33b6d745870c317cae906b0ddc48d0f59086680be71877" "q-98172/selection/83b77631d3c09c4fa65d5479e3bc4e111b6c74038becc428a014e32539abe18d" "q-98172/selection/7f9505671c58abccf439575598eeec0084788c95c03b11d193fb19cc1cc9fc36" "q-98172/selection/318eee683aae2a46f205bfe4f4689edbc0a16aa3ff94d37e2f6277a0545ad782" "q-98172/selection/03780b0af37883af25ced9c3bd0efb33896f2e93d42008232a40bdc73b0952ec"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-98172" :question/id #uuid "e0a8f71d-793f-5891-8d8f-395df7dbd166" :question/math-academy-id "q-98172" :question/problem "Calculate \n${\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{2}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨4,\\,-10,\\,-14⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "Let's reverse the limits of integration on the known result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =-{\\int }_{2}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-⟨4,\\,-10,\\,-14⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-4,\\,10,\\,14⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, applying the scalar multiplication rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot ⟨-4,\\,10,\\,14⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2,\\,5,\\,7⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-98172/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3eb7fd4f-f4bc-535e-b6bf-0c7df387a375"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-98172"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-129179/selection/3fd2b93d060290d29b8912af2ae327425c091afa93108e1d232b56406128a74e" :answer/id #uuid "0c2011a0-54e9-5ba5-89fb-b251d1fae5d5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-1,\\,5,\\,-6⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129179/selection/48781feae79e613e67545ab8bc62df5645c1d50d69ad7252b75a37710ea45caf" :answer/id #uuid "e6ff558c-8360-512c-bde3-20f957a5282f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨1,\\,-1,\\,3⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129179/selection/6a012591802c591473de016540b722296f6c319b30cba220f8ac365b9dc3c4a5" :answer/id #uuid "d04f570d-b83b-5daf-9e1d-5c916df8a5d5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨2,\\,-4,\\,-6⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129179/selection/c4fd64d991d3239f6f423a628f6103184af5859b8fcadefc0172e73fffb0f634" :answer/id #uuid "0b3b6fb2-1ea3-5ca3-a4a7-d4a066fe4bd1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-2,\\,-1,\\,-3⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129179/selection/9ac078689191a9b977fb934420fed2b6e1da9bb5c2ddea7091d7acf0c69f832e" :answer/id #uuid "bc4c23f1-722c-5251-8579-b13d6f31d8f4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨2,\\,8,\\,-2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129179/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "0b7542aa-9b6c-5998-bc1d-9e2f5d8669fb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-129179/selection/6a012591802c591473de016540b722296f6c319b30cba220f8ac365b9dc3c4a5" :answer-field/choices ["q-129179/selection/3fd2b93d060290d29b8912af2ae327425c091afa93108e1d232b56406128a74e" "q-129179/selection/48781feae79e613e67545ab8bc62df5645c1d50d69ad7252b75a37710ea45caf" "q-129179/selection/6a012591802c591473de016540b722296f6c319b30cba220f8ac365b9dc3c4a5" "q-129179/selection/c4fd64d991d3239f6f423a628f6103184af5859b8fcadefc0172e73fffb0f634" "q-129179/selection/9ac078689191a9b977fb934420fed2b6e1da9bb5c2ddea7091d7acf0c69f832e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-129179" :question/id #uuid "22f182f1-53be-5756-b864-1c157281bc4c" :question/math-academy-id "q-129179" :question/problem "Calculate \n${\\int }_{0}^{2}4f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{2}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-\\frac{1}{2},\\,1,\\,\\frac{3}{2}⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "Let's reverse the limits of integration on the known result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =-{\\int }_{2}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-⟨-\\frac{1}{2},\\,1,\\,\\frac{3}{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{1}{2},\\,-1,\\,-\\frac{3}{2}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, applying the scalar multiplication rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}4f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =4{\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =4\\cdot ⟨\\frac{1}{2},\\,-1,\\,-\\frac{3}{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2,\\,-4,\\,-6⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-129179/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3eb7fd4f-f4bc-535e-b6bf-0c7df387a375"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-129179"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-98096"] :question/problem "Calculate \n${\\int }_{0}^{1}2f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{1}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨1,\\,-3,\\,2⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "Let's reverse the limits of integration on the known result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =-{\\int }_{1}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-⟨1,\\,-3,\\,2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-1,\\,3,\\,-2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, applying the scalar multiplication rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}2f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =2{\\int }_{0}^{1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =2\\cdot ⟨-1,\\,3,\\,-2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2,\\,6,\\,-4⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-129268/selection/01d2422e5e9f582fc43c0d78c865ae6a3a8837c374729d25c711e654170794b5" :answer/id #uuid "df17aff7-1bf8-53c2-b657-9fcddc1d8a8d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨15,\\,-2,\\,8⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129268/selection/7aa79c39802bf48233a613dfa812adfa31f8a838d26910df616e6fc17fbbf4d4" :answer/id #uuid "c08d5330-68df-5a71-b760-f1a6262c6c3b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-9,\\,-10,\\,8⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129268/selection/86ae89c6d4b9807612447af7e5fa3c84c88fedc972e392f56a6049d12fddb9ab" :answer/id #uuid "6b4bfcbc-1507-5ff4-b49a-d36f018af706" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨9,\\,-12,\\,3⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129268/selection/108702e4743b651d9dad9ac2ac415b967bc93cae3f05d37cdb84c081d6260cee" :answer/id #uuid "df49835e-6680-5a81-a358-459a