i+j+3\\,k.$" :question/worked-solution "The dot product rule states that\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{2}c\\cdot f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=c\\cdot {\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\n \n\nApplying the dot-product rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}c\\cdot f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =c\\cdot {\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =(-i+j+3\\,k)\\cdot (16\\,i-10\\,j+4\\,k) \\\\  & =-16-10+12 \\\\  & =-14.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-34822/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1c8ee97e-f2b0-587e-9171-8008f1e0c4aa"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-34822"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-129295/selection/9f711e9a63e3c838b28dc4ca035d0daf6713191b518620f1f7898fd2e92e26c3" :answer/id #uuid "6cbb15c1-99e8-54e2-b9d8-be79228920f0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-i+5\\,j+k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129295/selection/d8cd9b112f58ac617f1bc73b56260435917df1f3051f7c5189599469828e57ed" :answer/id #uuid "058c2073-ae36-5180-8d95-23a41c3c4a48" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\,i-5\\,j+k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129295/selection/fa8988305b66e0e98f459422ca79be79b4d13a9cd18c2a4d6099167ab9f20da4" :answer/id #uuid "073e4645-cd7e-5c4c-954b-6839bf3a287d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "i+5\\,j+2\\,k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129295/selection/18be26e12bf914c5769dd7fd9f45a124fb3e7645aab9c6c9751e9c56f13aa5a4" :answer/id #uuid "455805d7-92b7-566e-9d03-b4349d38368d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2\\,i+2\\,j-k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129295/selection/76d559681cff487c2c0f172ab0a33d3249b3356a5c6dfcbab6f434e30fc195d0" :answer/id #uuid "b90297eb-9bb7-53a7-87a8-9fdf0d8ae156" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "i+3\\,j+k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129295/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "446bcf38-55fc-5b4f-bbe1-fda5400f6b5e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-129295/selection/fa8988305b66e0e98f459422ca79be79b4d13a9cd18c2a4d6099167ab9f20da4" :answer-field/choices ["q-129295/selection/9f711e9a63e3c838b28dc4ca035d0daf6713191b518620f1f7898fd2e92e26c3" "q-129295/selection/d8cd9b112f58ac617f1bc73b56260435917df1f3051f7c5189599469828e57ed" "q-129295/selection/fa8988305b66e0e98f459422ca79be79b4d13a9cd18c2a4d6099167ab9f20da4" "q-129295/selection/18be26e12bf914c5769dd7fd9f45a124fb3e7645aab9c6c9751e9c56f13aa5a4" "q-129295/selection/76d559681cff487c2c0f172ab0a33d3249b3356a5c6dfcbab6f434e30fc195d0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-129295" :question/id #uuid "83c1cbb9-3499-5072-a389-48a17caa791d" :question/math-academy-id "q-129295" :question/problem "Find ${\\int }_{0}^{3}c\\times f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$ \ngiven that \n${\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=i+j-3\\,k$ \nand \n$c=i-j+2\\,k.$" :question/worked-solution "The cross-product rule states that\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{3}c\\times f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=c\\times {\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\n \n\nApplying the cross-product rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{3}c\\times f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =c\\times {\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =(i-j+2\\,k)\\times (i+j-3\\,k) \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -3\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -3\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(3-2)i-(-3-2)j+(1+1)k \\\\  & =i+5\\,j+2\\,k.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-129295/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1c8ee97e-f2b0-587e-9171-8008f1e0c4aa"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-129295"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
